` there returns `SETTINGS.get(\"rate\")`.\n- **Missing key:** `settings.json:2` has the key `\"rat\"` instead of `\"rate\"`, so `.get(\"rate\")` returns `None`.\n- **Second call:** I didn't make it. The first call returned no task id, and the task tool has no parameter for resuming a subagent, so I couldn't pass one. I read `settings.json` myself, which is how I confirmed the missing key.\n\n**The fix:**\n- In `settings.json`, I renamed the key `\"rat\"` to `\"rate\"`.\n- In `app/pricing.py`, I changed `SETTINGS.get(\"rate\")` to `SETTINGS[\"rate\"]`. A missing key now raises a `KeyError` instead of returning `None`.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": null, "replies_throttled": null, "requests_cache_read": 103009, "requests_cache_write": 41669, "requests_cost_usd": 0.1411334, "requests_count": 12, "requests_input_uncached": 1215, "requests_output": 2423, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "opencode:trig-subagent-resume:claude-opus-5-5:trial22", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 147, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-17T03:00:03.257920+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 2, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 26.93, "t_checker_s": 0.175, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-subagent-resume", "task_calls": 1, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 3638, "tokens_cache_read": 103009, "tokens_cache_write": 41669, "tokens_fresh": 1749, "tokens_input_uncached": 1215, "tokens_main_cache_read": 78857, "tokens_main_cache_write": 34654, "tokens_main_calls": 7, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 16, "tokens_main_output": 1733, "tokens_output": 2423, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 103009, "tokens